WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.039 --> 00:00:03.345
- (speaking Hebrew)

00:00:05.221 --> 00:00:09.407
It means "What's up lady,
can I buy you a drink?"

00:00:09.866 --> 00:00:11.101
- Milky...

00:00:11.101 --> 00:00:12.536
- Snack Pack attack!

00:00:12.536 --> 00:00:14.224
- As a Jew, I should be
able to read this package,

00:00:14.224 --> 00:00:15.727
but I also dropped out of Hebrew school.

00:00:15.727 --> 00:00:17.812
- It looks like cottage cheese, maybe?

00:00:17.812 --> 00:00:19.028
- Okay, probably not.

00:00:19.028 --> 00:00:20.525
- Kinda smells like hot chocolate.

00:00:20.525 --> 00:00:21.517
- This is just chocolate pudding with

00:00:21.517 --> 00:00:22.442
whipped cream on top, basically.

00:00:22.442 --> 00:00:23.921
- [Girl] It's so good!
- [Guy] It's delicious.

00:00:23.921 --> 00:00:24.966
- What a treat.

00:00:24.966 --> 00:00:27.239
- Oh, it's so good.

00:00:27.485 --> 00:00:28.651
Oh my gosh.

00:00:28.651 --> 00:00:30.459
- Alright, Israelis.

00:00:30.459 --> 00:00:32.117
- It's ****ing Pop-Rocks in chocolate.

00:00:32.117 --> 00:00:33.896
- This looks like it could be dangerous.

00:00:33.896 --> 00:00:34.669
- Ain't no fire--

00:00:34.669 --> 00:00:35.636
Oh, whoa!

00:00:35.636 --> 00:00:38.027
- It crackles in your mouth.

00:00:39.057 --> 00:00:40.062
- Oh my god.

00:00:40.062 --> 00:00:42.115
- It's like when you're at, like a club,

00:00:42.115 --> 00:00:44.096
and you think the party's
over, but it's not,

00:00:44.096 --> 00:00:46.676
'cause it's still going
in my mouth right now.

00:00:46.696 --> 00:00:49.320
(crackling sound)

00:00:49.765 --> 00:00:50.924
- I can hear yours.

00:00:50.924 --> 00:00:52.005
- Fred and George Weasley would

00:00:52.005 --> 00:00:53.919
totally make something like this.

00:00:54.395 --> 00:00:56.628
- [Girl] Bamba Peanut Snack?

00:00:56.628 --> 00:00:57.988
- I think that's what
I'm gonna start calling

00:00:57.988 --> 00:01:00.016
I don't know, one of
my boyfriends, "Bamba!"

00:01:00.016 --> 00:01:02.148
- Bamba means baby, I'm guessing?

00:01:02.148 --> 00:01:02.941
- Bamba!

00:01:02.941 --> 00:01:03.874
Or basketball.

00:01:03.874 --> 00:01:06.514
- They look like Cheetos
but they smell like peanuts.

00:01:06.514 --> 00:01:08.877
- These are interesting.

00:01:09.046 --> 00:01:10.168
- I do not like it.

00:01:10.168 --> 00:01:11.974
- It's like putting a Cheeto in your mouth

00:01:11.974 --> 00:01:13.773
and then it turns into peanut butter.

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:15.950
- I hate them, but I want more of them.

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:18.244
- They're flavored wheat snacks.

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:20.080
That's like not an attractive slogan.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:20.762
(laughter)

00:01:20.762 --> 00:01:23.175
- Dude I think we could
dress up like these guys.

00:01:23.175 --> 00:01:25.136
- Who are these two cool cats?

00:01:25.136 --> 00:01:28.056
- I need an earring, and
a little bit of chin hair.

00:01:28.347 --> 00:01:30.482
- I think I got it.

00:01:30.482 --> 00:01:31.730
- That smells like falafel!

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:32.875
- Oh my god, it does!

00:01:32.875 --> 00:01:35.498
- The shape is not appealing, it's...

00:01:35.498 --> 00:01:38.187
honestly like some sort of rodent food.

00:01:38.187 --> 00:01:39.098
- I'm really in to these.

00:01:39.098 --> 00:01:40.061
- Yeah.

00:01:40.061 --> 00:01:41.395
- It's like a good bar snack.

00:01:41.395 --> 00:01:43.295
- You could break these down and use them

00:01:43.295 --> 00:01:44.647
as breading for fried chicken,

00:01:44.647 --> 00:01:46.415
you could put this on
your green been casserole,

00:01:46.415 --> 00:01:48.140
you could put it on your salad,

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:49.796
you could put it on your pitas.

00:01:49.796 --> 00:01:51.034
- Ice cream sandwiches.

00:01:51.034 --> 00:01:52.435
- Live it up!

00:01:52.435 --> 00:01:54.728
- [All] Mocha!

00:01:56.741 --> 00:01:58.051
- Oh, like a Goomba?

00:01:58.051 --> 00:01:59.082
- Yeah, kind of like a Goomba.

00:01:59.082 --> 00:02:00.341
- I think it looks a lot like a Diglet.

00:02:00.341 --> 00:02:02.014
- You know what, it looks like a Malamar.

00:02:02.014 --> 00:02:04.417
- But that looks like a lot of fun inside.

00:02:04.724 --> 00:02:06.975
- My question is, what is this?

00:02:06.975 --> 00:02:09.969
- The marshmallow is actually
a lot like Marshmallow Fluff.

00:02:09.969 --> 00:02:11.607
- There's a cookie at the bottom!

00:02:11.607 --> 00:02:13.156
- Delicious, it's just
a little cumbersome.

00:02:13.156 --> 00:02:15.096
- Whoever invented this snack,

00:02:15.096 --> 00:02:17.962
is just like a master of the craft.

00:02:18.608 --> 00:02:20.755
- [Girl] Pesek Zman!

00:02:20.755 --> 00:02:22.248
- It's a milk chocolate bar,

00:02:22.248 --> 00:02:24.728
filled with wafer and hazelnut cream.

00:02:24.728 --> 00:02:28.156
- Mmm! Sounds like Nutella!

00:02:28.156 --> 00:02:30.470
- Yeah it looks super gooey
and amazing on the thing,

00:02:30.470 --> 00:02:32.414
and then it just sort of looks like fuzzy.

00:02:32.414 --> 00:02:34.197
- This is like the
successful, globetrotting

00:02:34.197 --> 00:02:35.393
older brother of a KitKat.

00:02:35.393 --> 00:02:37.873
- Break me off a piece of that...

00:02:37.873 --> 00:02:39.644
Pesek Zman.

00:02:39.644 --> 00:02:40.666
- It's good.

00:02:40.666 --> 00:02:43.004
We approve, Israel. Good job.

00:02:43.004 --> 00:02:47.531
- I wonder if it's really
hard to find Bacon in Israel.

00:02:47.531 --> 00:02:49.121
- Yeah, of course it is.

00:02:49.121 --> 00:02:50.560
(laughter)

00:02:50.647 --> 00:02:52.799
- You would think that, how
like there's kosher places here

00:02:52.799 --> 00:02:54.573
that just sell kosher
food, there's un-kosher

00:02:54.573 --> 00:02:55.849
places in Israel--

00:02:55.849 --> 00:02:56.785
- [Guy] No!
- [Girl] That serves like

00:02:56.785 --> 00:02:58.440
bacon and lobsters, and that's it?

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:01.073
- The answer is no.

